<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 583.07, down 3.09.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 284 to 223.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.07.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 21,458,365 compared with 14,731,985 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
